WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.593
- I am now in front of the
American embassy in Kabul.

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:06.800
This used to be the heart
of the American effort

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.670
in Afghanistan for 20 years.

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:11.670
Now everybody's gone. And
the green zone of Kabul,

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.220
which used to be the nerf
center of the international

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:17.010
military operations and
civilian reconstruction efforts,

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.903
is now an abandoned ghost town.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.240
- Our senior officials also want this to

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:40.090
repair and build good
relations with them again,

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:41.690
and for the embassies to reopen.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.050
- You can see behind me some graffiti

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:54.910
a reminder of the old Afghanistan,

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:57.000
the African Republic that is now gone

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.790
and all these watch towers

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:00.870
of the international
coalition headquarters

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.933
that has also left Afghanistan
at the end of August.

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:19.600
- [Male] The American
embassy, as far as we know,

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:20.640
has not been penetrated.

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.730
However, the odds of American diplomats

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:25.410
returning to Kabul anytime
soon are quite low.

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:28.100
The US has not recognized
the Taliban government as the

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.560
legitimate rulers of Afghanistan,

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:31.800
and neither has any
other countries so far.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.390
The several others such as

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:35.747
China, Russia, or Qatar, or Pakistan,

00:01:35.747 --> 00:01:38.860
do maintain embassies in
this city and do engage in

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:40.810
contracts with the Taliban authorities.

